  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU over EIA-485, function 03 or 04 to read, 06 or 16 to write. Baud rate and address are set with the DIP switches (default 9600 bit/s, 8N1).",
    "Registers that apply to specific Aquarea series say so in their descriptions.",
    "Addresses are the protocol addresses of the manual (the PLC addresses less 1), from 0.",
    "Temperatures are in °C, °C x 10 or °F, as set with the DIP switches; their entries say so. Invalid values read 0xFFFF (unsigned) or 0x8000 (signed).",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual; not tested on a device."
  ],
